g AI marketing automation"},{"title":"AI vs automation: what's the difference?","slug":"ai-vs-automation","category":"AI","excerpt":"AI vs automation, explained without the hype. Automation follows fixed rules you wrote; AI makes judgment calls on messy input; intelligent automation combines them. Here's how each decides, where each wins, and how to choose.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/ai-vs-automation.webp","imageAlt":"A collaborative robot working alongside a human hand, comparing AI vs automation"},{"title":"Best AI automation tools (2026): an honest roundup","slug":"best-ai-automation-tools-2026","category":"AI","excerpt":"An honest, category-by-category roundup of the best AI automation tools in 2026 — no-code builders, RPA, agent frameworks, industrial, and iPaaS. What each is best for, the catch with each, and how to choose.","readMin":8,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/best-ai-automation-tools-2026.webp","imageAlt":"Logos of AI automation tools including ChatGPT, Zapier, Make, n8n and UiPath"},{"title":"How to automate a business process (step by step)","slug":"how-to-automate-a-business-process","category":"AI","excerpt":"How to automate a business process, step by step: pick the right process, map it, decide rules vs AI, choose tooling, pilot with a human in the loop, measure ROI, then scale and govern. A practical, no-hype playbook.","readMin":9,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/how-to-automate-a-business-process.webp","imageAlt":"Industrial robotic arms on an automated assembly line, illustrating how to automate a business process"},{"title":"What is AI automation? (and what it actually costs)","slug":"what-is-ai-automation","category":"AI","excerpt":"What is AI automation, explained without the hype. It's software that uses AI to handle work that judgment, not just fixed rules — here's how it differs from RPA, where it pays off, and what it actually costs to build.","readMin":8,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/ai-automation-what-is.webp","imageAlt":"An engineer observing a clean robotic arm in a modern facility, illustrating what AI automation is"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
